1) config_ultralytics_settings.json is the global config of the fine_tuning;
2) the dataset locaction includes two parts:
    1) 'datasets_dir' is specified in the config_ultralytics_settings.json;
    2) 'train'/'val' in data.yaml
    3) the 'datasets_dir' + 'train'  and 'datasets_dir' + 'val' are the locations of the data.
3) the files in the 'datasets_dir':
